  "description": "Aether mesh bridge for Bhengu.AI.Security.\n      Translates Aether telemetry events into transport-agnostic PeerSecurityEvents\n      and adapts the transport-agnostic intelligence output to implement\n      IAetherIntelligence and IAISecurityLayer.\n      Requires Bhengu.AI.Security (base layer) and Bhengu.AI.Aether (mesh contracts).",
